<BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/>
<BRL/><BRL/><BRL/></TAB></LST><BRK/></SPT>
<TAI OPT="CONTROL SCHEME B"><SPT><TTL>Pressure Control Valve (PCV)</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Only include if Scheme B Control is utilized.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Connect the PCV to I/O-1, I/O-2 and UPS #3 as indicated on the Terminal Block Connection drawing. Activate the 
graphical display enabled and closed lights and screen number 2 status based on the PLC's output status for the 
valve. Base the valve status on the table listed below.</TXT><BRK/>
<TXT><TAB HEADERROWS="2">
<WBK>
   <STS>
      <STY SID="s50">
         <ALN VERTICAL="BOTTOM"/>
      </STY>
      <STY SID="s51">
         <ALN HORIZONTAL="CENTER" VERTICAL="BOTTOM"/>
      </STY>
      <STY SID="s52">
         <ALN HORIZONTAL="CENTER"/>
      </STY>
   </STS>
   <TDA COLUMNCOUNT="5" ROWCOUNT="11">
      <COL STYLEID="s50" AUTOWIDTH="0" WIDTH="145.50"/>
      <COL STYLEID="s50" AUTOWIDTH="0" WIDTH="54.75"/>
      <COL AUTOWIDTH="0" WIDTH="87.00"/>
      <COL AUTOWIDTH="0" WIDTH="87.75"/>
      <COL AUTOWIDTH="0" WIDTH="81.75"/>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="17.25">
         <CEL MERGEACROSS="4" STYLEID="s51">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">Pressure Control Valve Operation - Two Solenoids</DTA>
         </CEL>
      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="35.25">
         <CEL STYLEID="s51">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">Fueling Mode per PCP Selector Switch</DTA>
         </CEL>
         <CEL STYLEID="s51">
