<BRL/><BRL/></TAB></TXT><BRK/></SPT>
</TAI><SPT><TTL>Backpressure Control Valve (BPCV)</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>The BPCV must be connected to I/O-1, I/O-2 and UPS #3 as indicated on the Terminal Block Connection drawing. 
The graphical display enabled and closed lights and screen number 2 status must activate based on the PLC's output 
status for the valve. The valve status must be based on the table listed below.</TXT><BRK/>
